#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:5
msgid ""
"Offrez-vous une création sur mesure ! Personnalisez vos articles de "
"maroquinerie ou macramé selon vos goûts. Je met mon savoir-faire à votre "
"service pour réaliser des pièces uniques et personnalisées."
msgstr ""
"Order your custom leather wallet, bag or western leather belt — handmade "
"tooled leather goods and macrame pieces made to order. A unique leather gift "
"for men or women."

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:8
msgid "Accessoires cuir & macramé personnalisés | Création sur mesure"
msgstr "Custom Leather Wallet, Bag & Macrame – Handmade to Order"

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:12
msgid ""
"Création sur mesure de maroquinerie et macramé - Personnalisez vos "
"accessoires"
msgstr "Custom Leather & Macramé Creations – Your Unique Piece, Made to Order"

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:13
msgid "Sac cuir sur mesure, repoussage cuir,"
msgstr ""
"Custom leather wallet, handmade leather bag, western leather belt or macrame "
"body chain — a handmade leather gift that truly means something."

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:18
msgid "title_custom_creation"
msgstr "Thinking about a custom piece? It all starts right here."

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:19
msgid "text_custom_creation"
msgstr ""
"Looking for a custom leather wallet, a handmade leather bag, or a western "
"leather belt made just for you? Whether it's a leather gift for a man or a "
"woman who loves beautiful materials, or a one-of-a-kind macrame piece, I "
"bring your vision to life — entirely handmade, from tooled leather goods to "
"woven macrame creations."

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:22
msgid "Votre création sur mesure, étape par étape"
msgstr "Your Custom Piece, Step by Step"

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:25
msgid "Échange initial :"
msgstr "First conversation :"

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:25
msgid ""
"Contactez-moi par e-mail ou téléphone pour discuter de votre projet et "
"obtenir une première estimation."
msgstr ""
"We discuss your project by email or phone to understand your vision and I "
"provide an initial estimate for your custom leather or macrame piece."

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:26
msgid "Conception :"
msgstr "Personalised design :"

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:26
msgid "Réalisation d’un croquis détaillé et établissement d’un devis précis."
msgstr ""
"I sketch your piece and provide a detailed quote based on materials, format "
"and finishing"

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:27
msgid "Début de la fabrication :"
msgstr "Production starts :"

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:27
msgid "Un acompte de 1/3 du prix est demandé pour lancer la production."
msgstr ""
"Once the deposit (one third) is received, I start crafting your piece in my "
"travelling workshop, wherever I am in Europe."

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:28
msgid "Validation :"
msgstr "Adjustments & approval :"

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:28
msgid ""
"Je vous envoie des visuels pour finaliser les motifs et ajuster les détails "
"si nécessaire."
msgstr ""
"I send you visuals to validate the tooled leather patterns and adjust any "
"details before completion."

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:29
msgid "Livraison :"
msgstr "Careful delivery :"

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:29
msgid ""
"Une fois le paiement final effectué, votre création est expédiée en toute "
"sécurité avec assurance."
msgstr ""
"Once the balance is settled, your custom leather or macramé creation is "
"shipped with care and insurance, ready to find its place in your life."

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:34
msgid "Découvrez mes réalisations"
msgstr "Custom Creation Examples"

#: .\core\templates\core\custom_creation.html:54
msgid "Pourquoi choisir mes créations unique?"
msgstr "Why Choose a Handmade Custom Piece?"

